# GitHub PR Comments

When posting any comment to a GitHub PR — reviews, feedback, status updates —
use the `/gh-comment` skill at `.claude/skills/gh-comment/SKILL.md`.

Read the skill file and follow its format and posting procedure. Never post
bare comments without the standard `🤖 {Name}` header.
